{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Immerse your skin in the ultimate hydration sanctuary. The Rose Garden combines nutrient-dense Rosehip Oil with classic Rose and warm Vanilla to drench dry, depleted skin in essential fatty acids. This deeply emollient bar repairs your moisture barrier, leaving skin touch-ably soft, plumped, and velvety smooth.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>The Rose Garden is a deeply restorative, moisture-rich bar designed to intensely hydrate, smooth, and comfort dry or aging skin. The synergy of rosehip oil, pure rose extract, and warm vanilla delivers heavy-duty nourishment while reinforcing the skin's natural moisture barrier.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Intense Moisture Lock: Rosehip oil penetrates deeply to deliver essential fatty acids (Omega-3, 6, and 9) that quench dry skin</li>
                    <li>Barrier Repair: The rich lipids naturally strengthen the skin's outer layer, preventing moisture loss throughout the day</li>
                    <li>Scar &amp; Texture Smoothing: Vitamin A and C in rosehip oil promote tissue regeneration to fade blemishes and smooth rough patches</li>
                    <li>Anti-Inflammatory Relief: Natural rose extract tones the skin while cooling irritation, redness, and sensitive areas</li>
                    <li>Elasticity Boost: Antioxidants protect collagen fibers, helping to firm sagging skin and soften the appearance of fine lines</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Dry, dehydrated, or mature skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goat Milk, Honey, Rose Hip Powder, Rose Hip Oil, Vanilla Oil, Organic Rose Oil, Organic Gardenia Oil, Organic Clove Oil, and Black Rose &amp; Oud FO.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Lather generously over face and body to lock in long-lasting moisture and comfort.</p></div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-care' %}
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Storage / Safety Disclaimer<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <p><strong>Safety Disclaimer:</strong> For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.</p>
    <p><strong>Aromatherapy &amp; Herbal Note:</strong> This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.</p>
  </div>
</div>
{% render 'rb-acc-shipping' %}
{%- endif -%}
